    "wa_post / wa_style / wa_extra. Nothing here reaches a /bhav page.",
    "",
    "WHY THIS FILE IS NOT data/state_lang.json:",
    "state_lang refuses every non-Devanagari script on load, on purpose — the",
    "2026-08-24 finding was that 0 of 1,841 SEARCH queries used one, so adding",
    "Tamil or Malayalam /bhav URLs would be index bloat with no demand behind",
    "it. That finding is about SEARCH. A WhatsApp channel is not search: the",
    "follower of krashimitra_kerala already chose Kerala, and the post arriving",
    "in Hindi is not a ranking problem, it is a message he cannot read. Two",
    "surfaces, two answers, two files — and state_lang's guard stays exactly as",
    "strict as it was.",
    "",
    "GRAMMAR RULE, same as state_lang's: NOUN-STACKED THROUGHOUT. No template",
    "may inflect around a placeholder, because {crop} and {market} arrive as",
    "bare nouns and every one of these languages would need a different ending.",
    "Write '{market} — സർക്കാർ റിപ്പോർട്ട്', never '{market}ന്റെ റിപ്പോർട്ട്'.",
    "",
    "PER-STRING FALLBACK: anything absent here falls back to the Hindi in",
    "services/wa_style, one key at a time. A half-written block costs one line",
    "and never a post.",
    "",
    "Keys: <tone>.<slot> for the five tones (seedha, bazaari, saathi, report,",
    "sankshipt), label.<slot> for the format words, extra.<slot> for the",
    "optional line services/wa_extra offers.",
